<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Bushido</h1>
<p><i>The Bushido clan's own page, kept as the clan wrote it.</i>
</p><p>We are a clan devoted to honour, and truth. We allow only the finest people in the game into our ranks. As the name implies Honour and respect are our main motto. If you have a problem with one of us, you have a problem with all of us. We strive to respect other players and to help players in and not in the clan.
</p><p>The Bushido clan has been around for a long time, and is now one of the oldest clans in Valhalla. The idea behind the clan originally being that there should form an alliance of people willing to help others, and at the same time gain respect, and aid that they themselves may not be able to acquire.
</p><p>In our clan we have many ranks and positions of importance. Our monetary system is more intended to help those of lower levels who cannot gain enough to provide for themselves, and therefore we have an abundance. In respect to killing other players, In the Bushido clan we only do so in defense of our clan..our members..or a player seeking aid. We do not kill for the sheer joy of it, but that does not imply we are weak. We are one of the strongest clans in Valhalla.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Abbreviated_Clan_Rules">Abbreviated Clan Rules</span></h2>
<p>1. Help people, that is what this clan is all about. It doesn't matter if it's another clans member you are helping or our own, or a newbie or an oldbie, We help players
</p><p>2. Titles are only free on the first time. Any title a clan member asks for after the first must be paid for by that clan member.
</p><p>3. Do not aggressivley seek pk. Please note however that if you are bob'd and someone attacks you first, you must defend yourself.
</p><p>4.Language. Please refrain from using abusive language abusive language in the newbie comm channel or on the shout channel. Also please note that if you are not signed in the book of blood, you have no right bad mouthing or name calling anyone who is signed. Being non bob and antagonizing someone else may get you signed whether you want it or not.
</p><p>5.Equipment. If you have no use for equipment that you used to wear, please open a storage spot in udgaard or torsbay and save the eq for a new player.
</p><p>6.Recruiting. We do not accept people who are already in a clan. If someone wishes to leave his or her clan, they must be clanless for 6 weeks or more before being allowed to join Bushido.
</p><p>7.If you are in the Bushido clan you CANNOT have another character in a different clan. You may choose to have your alternate characters remain clanless, however they cannot join any other clan.
</p><p><br />
</p><p>See Also:
</p>
